B.aij=s(["Dashboard and ledger pages now show flag buttons only for currencies used in the selected month, updating income, expense, advance expense, balance, and charts together.","Other-currency subtotals now appear below the ledger list for a clearer reading order.","Vertical phone scrolling animates the top and bottom bars in opposite directions, with centered handles to restore either bar."],t.s)
